# Quanta repo: ignore EVERYTHING unless explicitly allowed.
#
# Only these are tracked on the remote:
#   README.md   - project readme (root only)
#   .gitignore  - this file
#   compiler/   - the Quanta self-hosting source + promoted binaries
#   docs/       - documentation
#   lib/        - standard library source
#
# Everything else is internal/local and must NOT be pushed:
#   systems/ agents/ bootstrap/ test_suites/ tools/ scripts/ bin/ src/
#   .github/ .hyperresearch/ .claude/ scratch/ temp/ and all junk.

/*

# --- explicitly ALLOWED ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!/compiler/
!/docs/
!/lib/
!/tree-sitter-quanta/

# --- internal / local-only (never pushed) ---
systems/
agents/
bootstrap/
test_suites/
tools/
scripts/
.hyperresearch/
.claude/
scratch/
temp/

# --- junk ---
vgcore.*
*.core
*.bin
qfio_test.bin
raw.txt
rt.txt
ergz_pass_placeholder

# compiler-specific: keep compiler/ tracked, but exclude internal noise
compiler/*/STATE.md
compiler/*/src/**/qc
**/src/**/qc
qc_boot
qc_self
qc_boot_n
qc_self2
